    "text": "St. Louis\nSt. Louis Police ramp up July 4 safety after last year's chaos\n1 hours ago\nSt. Louis Police say many of these changes stem from the chaos that happened last year. One of their main messages: leave the guns at home and the fireworks to the pros. Matt Ratz, co-owner of U-Kraft, remembers vividly the call he received telling him that their new location downtown, set to open weeks later, was shot up on July 4.",
